        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8521WS, Rectangular Crystal Windsor Knob with matching Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Windsor Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose has a wonderful, modern appearance that makes it a timeless way to bring the traditional into the contemporary. The Rectangular Crystal Windsor Knob with matching Rectangular Rose is available in several beautiful finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Windsor Knob and Rectangular Rose will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Windsor Door Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Knob and Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Windsor Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Windsor Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose has a wonderful, modern appearance that makes it a timeless way to bring the traditional into the contemporary. The Rectangular Crystal Windsor Knob with matching Neos Rose is available in several beautiful finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Windsor Knob and Neos Rose will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick.",
